  "sourceBoundary": "The owner's Professor X selection from this page, verified against it: the crucial-issue picks of the Silver Age, Claremont and New X-Men sections, then X-Men: Deadly Genesis #1-6, Uncanny X-Men #475-486, New Avengers: Illuminati #1-5 and X-Men: Legacy #208-225, in the page's order from Uncanny X-Men #12 through X-Men Legacy #225. Event collections, other bonus reads, the alternate-reality section, House of X and Latest Additions are owner-directed follow-ons, recorded as exclusions rather than issue rows.",
